@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_AUTHENTICATED_TOKEN
@tenantId = REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZATION_ID
@systemId = REPLACE_WITH_ASSIGNED_SYSTEM_ID
@source = local
@recordId = REPLACE_WITH_SOURCE_RECORD_ID
@sourceRevision = COPY_FROM_LATEST_ITEM
@relationshipRevision = COPY_FROM_DETAIL
@operationId = COPY_FROM_PREPARE_RESPONSE
@operationRevision = 0
@proposalId = COPY_FROM_DETAIL
@proposalRevision = 0
@controlId = AC-1
@narrativeVersion = 0
@baselineId = COPY_FROM_DETAIL
@responsibilitySourceRevision = COPY_FROM_CONTROL_AVAILABLE_SOURCE_REVISION
@responsibilityReviewRevision = COPY_FROM_CONTROL_REVIEW_REVISION
@root = {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/organizations/{{tenantId}}/systems/{{systemId}}/security-capabilities
@componentId = COPY_FROM_SOURCE_QUALIFIED_COMPONENT
@boundaryId = COPY_FROM_PLACEMENT_OPTIONS
@placementId = COPY_FROM_PLACEMENT_OPTIONS
@placementRevision = COPY_FROM_PLACEMENT_OPTIONS

### Placement permissions are separate from provider authorship. Refresh tokens before either mutation.
GET {{root}}/{{source}}/component/{{componentId}}/placements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### MUTATION: adds only a real selected-system boundary placement; does not auto-subscribe a capability.
POST {{root}}/{{source}}/component/{{componentId}}/placements/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{"boundaryId":"{{boundaryId}}","sourceRevision":"{{sourceRevision}}","relationshipRevision":"{{relationshipRevision}}"}

### MUTATION: refresh options after assign; canUnassign must be true for this exact placement.
### This retains other placements/systems, capabilities, source metadata and approved narratives.
POST {{root}}/{{source}}/component/{{componentId}}/placements/{{placementId}}/unassign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceRevision":"{{sourceRevision}}","relationshipRevision":"{{relationshipRevision}}","placementRevision":"{{placementRevision}}"}

### Manual only: use a disposable local system. No cloud/domain data is written by the test suite.
### Applied capabilities; changing grouping to component includes directly assigned orphan components.
GET {{root}}?scope=applied&grouping=capability&page=1&pageSize=25&sort=name&direction=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Available library is distinct from current applicability; applied entries are explicitly marked.
GET {{root}}?scope=available&grouping=component&componentType=Person&boundaryId=unassigned
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Source-qualified detail: safe evidence URLs, independent Policy/Technical, actual control allocations.
GET {{root}}/{{source}}/capability/{{recordId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Prepare persists a draft ONLY. Add selections/placements/supports before sending.
### Provider placements require a real selected-system boundary. Never paste a source from another tenant.
POST {{root}}/setups/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "local-system-capability-manual-1",
  "selections": [{
    "source": "{{source}}",
    "recordId": "{{recordId}}",
    "sourceRevision": "{{sourceRevision}}",
    "placements": [],
    "supportingCapabilities": []
  }]
}

### Recover immutable plan/outcomes; exact selected-system CanManageSystem is required.
GET {{root}}/setups/{{operationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### MUTATION: inspect plannedWrites first; copy revision from prepare/recovery.
### Repeating after completion returns persisted outcomes. Partial retries execute incomplete writes only.
POST {{root}}/setups/{{operationId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision": {{operationRevision}}}

### Removal PREVIEW only. Reuse recover/complete above to execute after reviewing.
### Other systems, shared source records, component placements and approved narratives must remain.
POST {{root}}/{{source}}/capability/{{recordId}}/removals/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "local-system-capability-removal-1",
  "sourceRevision": "{{sourceRevision}}",
  "relationshipRevision": "{{relationshipRevision}}"
}

### OPTIONAL AI MUTATION: explicit source-bound generation; never updates approved content.
POST {{root}}/{{source}}/capability/{{recordId}}/narrative-proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controlId": "{{controlId}}",
  "narrativeType": "Policy",
  "expectedVersion": {{narrativeVersion}},
  "sourceRevision": "{{sourceRevision}}"
}

### OPTIONAL review MUTATION: separate authorized reviewer, exact source origin and current proposal revision.
POST {{root}}/{{source}}/capability/{{recordId}}/narrative-proposals/{{proposalId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision": {{proposalRevision}}, "decision": "RequestRevision", "note": "Manual local review: clarify supporting evidence."}

### OPTIONAL responsibility MUTATION: assigned ISSM/ISSO only; both checks and notes are required.
### Use a provider capability and its per-control responsibility tokens, NOT the inventory sourceRevision.
POST {{root}}/provider/capability/{{recordId}}/responsibilities/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: organization
X-Workspace-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baselineId": "{{baselineId}}",
  "sourceRevision": "{{responsibilitySourceRevision}}",
  "reviewRevision": "{{responsibilityReviewRevision}}",
  "providerCoverageVerified": true,
  "customerDutiesReviewed": true,
  "reviewNotes": "Manual local review: verified coverage and customer duties against the displayed source.",
  "allocations": [{
    "controlId": "{{controlId}}",
    "inheritanceType": "Shared",
    "provider": "REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_PROVIDER",
    "customerResponsibility": "REPLACE_WITH_REVIEWED_CUSTOMER_DUTY"
  }]
}

### Negative checks: change tenant/system, remove management role, alter sourceRevision or expectedRevision.
### Expect explicit 404/403/409, no success-shaped defaults, and no cross-system writes.
